    "title": "讀懂波斯地毯紋樣",
    "body": "<p>從形狀開始，追問背景，保留不確定性。</p><p>Persian Rug Motifs: Forms, Context, and Meanings</p><p>五個主題，一套可以回查來源的閱讀方法。</p>",
    "wiki": "index",
    "evidence": [],
    "visual": "<figure><img class=\"art\" src=\"assets/met-447525.jpg\" alt=\"Irregular light-ground carpet fragment with floral decoration and a dark central pendant form.\"><figcaption>Fragment of a Northwest Persian Medallion Carpet. The Metropolitan Museum of Art · 22.100.67. James F. Ballard Collection, Gift of James F. Ballard, 1922. Public Domain / Met Open Access. <a href=\"images.html#I02\">Credit / 圖片來源</a></figcaption></figure>",
