    "number": 2,
    "title": "先觀察，再解釋",
    "body": "<p><b>觀察 Observation：</b>描述看得見的形狀。</p><p><b>歷史主張 Historical claim：</b>回查年代、材質與產地紀錄。</p><p><b>詮釋 Interpretation：</b>說明由誰提出、依據是什麼。</p><p><b>不確定 Uncertain：</b>證據不足，就不下結論。</p>",
    "wiki": "workflow",
    "evidence": [],
    "visual": "",
    "note": "這四類是本專案的編輯規則，不是地毯本身的分類。"
  },
  {
    "number": 3,
    "title": "先找地心與邊框",
    "body": "<p>地心（field / matn / متن）是邊框內的主要區域。</p><p>主邊框、次邊框與窄分隔帶，幫助我們定位紋樣。</p><p>先說「在哪裡」，再說「像什麼」。</p>",
    "wiki": "structure",
    "evidence": [
      "S01-E1"
    ],
    "visual": "<div class=\"diagram\"><svg role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Simplified structure teaching diagram, not a museum object\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 330\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"10\" width=\"260\" height=\"310\" fill=\"#913e32\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"20\" width=\"240\" height=\"290\" fill=\"#d8b56f\"/><rect x=\"42\" y=\"32\" width=\"216\" height=\"266\" fill=\"#496762\"/><rect x=\"72\" y=\"62\" width=\"156\" height=\"206\" fill=\"#d8b56f\"/><rect x=\"82\" y=\"72\" width=\"136\" height=\"186\" fill=\"#fff9ef\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Field / 地心</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\">matn / متن</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:white;font-size:13px\">Main border / 主邊框</text></svg><div class=\"caption\">Original teaching schematic / 原創教學示意圖<br>Not a historical object or an identification template.</div></div>",
    "note": ""
