    "visual": "<figure><img class=\"art\" src=\"assets/met-452066.jpg\" alt=\"Full carpet with a red field, blue scrolling bands and a blue floral border.\"><figcaption>Floral Arabesque Carpet. The Metropolitan Museum of Art · 69.244. Rogers Fund, 1969. Public Domain / Met Open Access. <a href=\"images.html#I01\">Credit / 圖片來源</a></figcaption></figure>",
