</div><p>Palmette</p></div><div><div class=\"diagram\"><svg role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Simplified islimi teaching diagram, not a museum object\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 330\"><path d=\"M40 280C260 290 280 100 160 100C60 100 75 220 145 210C230 200 160 40 260 35\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#496762\" stroke-width=\"12\"/><path d=\"M135 235Q80 245 72 190Q115 200 135 235M200 140Q245 130 245 80Q210 92 200 140\" fill=\"#913e32\"/></svg><div class=\"caption\">Original teaching schematic / 原創教學示意圖<br>Not a historical object or an identification template.</div></div><p>Islimi</p></div><div><div class=\"diagram\"><svg role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Simplified toranj-lachak teaching diagram, not a museum object\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 330\"><rect x=\"45\" y=\"20\" width=\"210\" height=\"290\" fill=\"#e8dfcf\" stroke=\"#a07736\" stroke-width=\"10\"/><path d=\"M150 90L202 165 150 240 98 165Z M52 28L102 28 52 78Z M248 28L198 28 248 78Z M52 302L102 302 52 252Z M248 302L198 302 248 252Z\" fill=\"#913e32\"/></svg><div class=\"caption\">Original teaching schematic / 原創教學示意圖<br>Not a historical object or an identification template.</div></div><p>Toranj / Lachak</p></div></div><details><summary>顯示答案</summary><p>Herati 要看整組重複。Toranj / Lachak 要看中心與角隅。單一局部裁切可能缺少判讀所需的關係。</p></details>",
